{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NlmaIzvOZG1794904427.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[16:30]</p><p>天文台：一道冷鋒已在華南北部形成，並會在明日（11月18日）稍後橫過廣東沿岸。本港會有一兩陣雨，晚上氣溫下降。隨後一兩日天氣顯著轉涼，星期五及星期六市區最低氣溫在15、16度左右，新界再低兩三度。此外，受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及星期六初時高地風寒效應會較為明顯及寒冷。市民特別是進行戶外活動的人士請留意天氣變化，注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206799-%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E5%8B%95%E6%85%8B%E5%9C%96%E6%9C%AC%E5%91%A8%E5%BE%8C%E6%9C%9F%E5%86%B7%E5%B3%B0%E6%AE%BA%E5%88%B0%E5%8D%B3%E7%9D%87%E7%B4%AB%E8%97%8D%E5%AF%92%E6%BD%AE%E4%BD%95%E6%99%82%E5%88%B0%E4%BE%86%E9%99%84%E4%B9%9D%E5%A4%A9%E9%A0%90%E5%A0%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣動態圖｜本周後期冷峰殺到　即睇「紫藍」寒潮何時到來｜附九天預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.777740+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:40.151463+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:24:59.077890+00:00","content_hash":"1b0ab695dcdf0641007c13e185499044c36ab929f2b9f4cb337bd50312a55ec7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:31:39.777740+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}